{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110997","id":2867685316,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6q7WfE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110997","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110997.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110997.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110997","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110997/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110997/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110997/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ccd36efce1d9a0db91bbedeb028607b72a239af0","number":110997,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement the Ground Truth Ambient Occlusion (GTAO) effect","user":{"login":"HydrogenC","id":33123710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMTIzNzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33123710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC","html_url":"https://github.com/HydrogenC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HydrogenC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves <https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3223>, but for 4.x. \r\n\r\nShowcase: \r\n<img width=\"3960\" height=\"3000\" alt=\"collage\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f0145bb-4c24-4e1c-83b2-cdfffcf91e39\" />\r\nIn medium quality, the visual quality of GTAO is comparable to ASSAO, while in Ultra quality, GTAO outperforms ASSAO conspicuously. \r\nNote: Due to algorithm differences, the parameters cannot perfectly map between ASSAO and GTAO (for example, ASSAO **intensity 2.0** and GTAO **intensity 1.0** gives visually similar AO strengths). This could be balanced by adding a multiplier for some parameters if required. \r\n\r\nTogglable by UI: \r\n<img width=\"1375\" height=\"533\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7bdedc8-78c8-462a-be33-2a2b56e5a569\" />\r\n\r\n## Implementation details\r\nMain gather logic was taken from the GTAO implementation of Unreal Engine and [flower renderer](https://github.com/qiutang98/flower/blob/main/source/shader/gtao/gtao_evaluate.glsl). Also referenced [XeGTAO](https://github.com/GameTechDev/XeGTAO/blob/master/Source/Rendering/Shaders/XeGTAO.hlsli) to check the correctness of some computational details.  \r\nBlur and interleave part has reused the edge-aware smart blur that ASSAO also depends on.  \r\nGTAO isn't much more costly than ASSAO, but as a high-quality effect, it isn't intended for super low-end scenarios. Thus, the effect is only implemented for RendererRD without support for the Compatibility backend. \r\n\r\n## Questions\r\nUpon implementing the effect, I noticed that the ASSAO gather is run four times with four different depth textures that's packed into a texture array, and then averaged between the four values produced. I don't understand what's the real purpose for this and whether I can remove this logic and only run the gather once for GTAO. Could anyone explain this for me? \r\n\r\n## Possible future improvements\r\nA \"full\" implementation of GTAO would have to include a temporal filter pass. The current implementation omits the temporal filtering step, as lacking it won't considerably make the visual quality degenerate (if a better result is needed, enabling TAA would compensate for the lack of temporal filtering, though it still looks fine without TAA enabled). Temporal filtering could be added in the future through a separate PR by me or anyone else who's willing to contribute, to make the effect look even better. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-28T12:00:44Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:42Z","closed_at":"2025-11-29T07:23:26Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"HydrogenC:gtao","ref":"gtao","repo":{"id":930935161,"node_id":"R_kgDON3zxeQ","name":"godot","f